  "title": "Response on TotalEnergies’ Alleged “Superprofits”",
  "summary": "1 – Oil and gas profits are generated and taxed in producing countries TotalEnergies’ results in oil and gas are not generated in France, but overwhelmingly in the countries where hydrocarbons are produced (Africa, the Middle East, the Americas, Asia-Pacific). In these countries, profits are subject to specific tax regimes, including royalties, production taxes and corporate income tax. […]",
